{"assets":["/statement-assets/34ada3f02c282d0e34ef1808f4abc30bec1b1a2dffd1b1b412567e2479c47eef.png","/statement-assets/c7238dc32943c950aa11076dd0bcf21aa66fdb0dc065c3623150f8b3a46dbdbd.png","/statement-assets/9846ef03c10075416ceb00db2c122f55ddba5cdbcb34fb36bd799309c790f711.png","/statement-assets/bfa16f772fcaedb4bb35edf14dfc4a827370073854c15830608f81aed856667b.png","/statement-assets/def6d5f5646477433addd0336bfc67258371796d65d5bc8e3140c8fe1fb0b5fb.png","/statement-assets/72d162074d72c9fac473894b50d6f9d0fa0171496425e42f094c1d004f36a677.png","/statement-assets/0cde7feff2f8c2378789668b5f28db84fb6825b8c6765e96ac37212bbee3523c.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"593","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Happy Tree Party"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Bogdan has a birthday today and mom gave him a tree consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" vertecies. For every edge of the tree "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":", some number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" was written on it. In case you forget, a tree is a connected non-directed graph without cycles. After the present was granted, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" guests consecutively come to Bogdan's party. When the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th guest comes, he performs exactly one of the two possible operations: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chooses some number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":", and two vertecies "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that, he moves along the edges of the tree from vertex "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" to vertex "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" using the shortest path (of course, such a path is unique in the tree). Every time he moves along some edge "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":", he replaces his current number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" by "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/34ada3f02c282d0e34ef1808f4abc30bec1b1a2dffd1b1b412567e2479c47eef.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", that is, by the result of integer division "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" div "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xj"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Chooses some edge "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and replaces the value written in it "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xpi"},{"kind":"text","text":" by some positive integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci < xpi"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As Bogdan cares about his guests, he decided to ease the process. Write a program that performs all the operations requested by guests and outputs the resulting value "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" for each "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the first type."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains integers, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 200 000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ m ≤ 200 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of vertecies in the tree granted to Bogdan by his mom and the number of guests that came to the party respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the description of the edges. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of these lines contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ui"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ui, vi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ui ≠ vi"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ xi ≤ 1018"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting an edge that connects vertecies "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ui"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"vi"},{"kind":"text","text":", with the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" initially written on it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe operations, requested by Bogdan's guests. Each description contains three or four integers and has one of the two possible forms: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" corresponds to a guest, who chooses the operation of the first type. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" corresponds to a guests, who chooses the operation of the second type. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" It is guaranteed that all the queries are correct, namely "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai, bi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ pi ≤ n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ yi ≤ 1018"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ci < xpi"},{"kind":"text","text":", where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xpi"},{"kind":"text","text":" represents a number written on edge "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"pi"},{"kind":"text","text":" at this particular moment of time that is not necessarily equal to the initial value "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xpi"},{"kind":"text","text":", as some decreases may have already been applied to it. The edges are numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" in the order they appear in the input."}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each guest who chooses the operation of the first type, print the result of processing the value "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" through the path from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 6\n1 2 1\n1 3 7\n1 4 4\n2 5 5\n2 6 2\n1 4 6 17\n2 3 2\n1 4 6 17\n1 5 5 20\n2 4 1\n1 5 1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n4\n20\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 4\n1 2 7\n1 3 3\n3 4 2\n3 5 5\n1 4 2 100\n1 5 4 1\n2 2 2\n1 1 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n0\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially the tree looks like this: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c7238dc32943c950aa11076dd0bcf21aa66fdb0dc065c3623150f8b3a46dbdbd.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The response to the first query is: "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/9846ef03c10075416ceb00db2c122f55ddba5cdbcb34fb36bd799309c790f711.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 2"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the third edge is changed, the tree looks like this: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/bfa16f772fcaedb4bb35edf14dfc4a827370073854c15830608f81aed856667b.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The response to the second query is: "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/def6d5f5646477433addd0336bfc67258371796d65d5bc8e3140c8fe1fb0b5fb.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 4"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third query the initial and final vertex coincide, that is, the answer will be the initial number 20."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the change in the fourth edge the tree looks like this: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/72d162074d72c9fac473894b50d6f9d0fa0171496425e42f094c1d004f36a677.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the last query the answer will be: "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/0cde7feff2f8c2378789668b5f28db84fb6825b8c6765e96ac37212bbee3523c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 3"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"593D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/593/problem/D"}